const content="<article data-editorial-version=\"3\" class=\"sn-page\"><div class=\"sn-read\"><a href=\"/supporters/\">← Featured sponsors</a><p class=\"sn-kicker\">Marine Diesel Engine · Sponsor feature</p><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/shakesure/logo.webp\" alt=\"ShakeSure logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\"><h1>ShakeSure: strong anchor chain for your cruising boat</h1><p class=\"sn-intro\">Explore ShakeSure anchor chain for strength, corrosion resistance and correct windlass fit, with galvanised, stainless-steel and duplex choices. For boat owners, it is a specialist range for an essential piece of equipment used when the engine is stopped and the boat lies at anchor.</p><img class=\"sn-hero\" src=\"/images/supporters/shakesure/chain.webp\" alt=\"ShakeSure electropolished stainless steel anchor chain\" width=\"900\" height=\"1200\"><section><h2>Compare the material choices</h2><p>CORE is the galvanised range, ELITE is stainless steel and APEX is duplex. These offer different options for a product that is repeatedly loaded, submerged and hauled aboard. ShakeSure also describes manual inspection as part of its approach.</p><p>We like that the emphasis is on working qualities. Anchor chain spends much of its life out of sight, but its material and condition deserve the same practical attention owners give to other load-bearing equipment.</p></section><section><h2>Make the chain work with the windlass</h2><p>The gypsy needs chain of suitable dimensions. ShakeSure offers fitment assistance, helping owners check the requirements of the machinery handling the chain before placing an order.</p><p>That is a useful part of the service. We appreciate buying advice that connects the new component to the equipment already installed, rather than treating material selection as the only decision.</p></section><section><h2>Why we feature ShakeSure</h2><p>Preparing a cruising boat involves both propulsion and the equipment that keeps it in place once it stops. ShakeSure addresses the latter with clear material options and related anchoring products.</p><p>We feature the brand because its benefits are straightforward: strong chain, resistance to the marine environment and help choosing the correct fit. Those are practical considerations whether an owner is replacing worn gear or reviewing the setup on a recently purchased boat.</p></section><div class=\"sn-contact\"><a href=\"https://www.shakesure.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Explore ShakeSure anchor chains ↗</a><a href=\"/supporters/\">More featured sponsors</a></div></div></article><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Article\", \"headline\": \"ShakeSure: strong anchor chain for your cruising boat\", \"description\": \"Explore ShakeSure anchor chain for strength, corrosion resistance and correct windlass fit, with galvanised, stainless-steel and duplex choices.\", \"image\": \"https://marinedieselengine.com.au/images/supporters/shakesure/chain.webp\", \"author\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Marine Diesel Engine\"}, \"dateModified\": \"2026-11-05\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": \"https://marinedieselengine.com.au/supporters/shakesure/\"}</script>";
